   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Tout en + gerund",
     "texto": [
      "**Tout en** + gerund means «a la vez que» (at the same time as, while): **Tout en mangeant, tu parles trop** (while you eat, you talk too much).",
      "It is used to stress that both things happen at the same time."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "En + gerund as a condition",
     "texto": [
      "**En étudiant, tu réussiras** (if you study, you will succeed). This is how you say what has to be done to achieve something."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
